			l5-5.4l4.9,4.6c0.2,0.2,0.4,0.2,0.6,0l8.4-7.9l0.1-0.1c1.2-1.2,1.9-2.3,2.3-3.6c0.4-1.3,0.3-2.7-0.2-3.9L35,6.3
